## Speculation  
- Could the GASLIT-AF model be applied to other complex chronic conditions beyond CMSS, such as autoimmune disorders or psychiatric illnesses?  
- Might the proposed genetic mechanisms (e.g., RCCX gene module) explain overlapping symptomatology across seemingly unrelated syndromes?  
- Is the focus on attractor states and feedback loops a novel contribution to understanding these conditions, or does it reframe existing hypotheses in a new mathematical framework?  
